      "tr": "`B @ A` `W` ile aynı şekilde.",
      "en": "`B @ A` has the same shape as `W`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Ölçek `alpha / A.shape[0]`.",
      "en": "The scale is `alpha / A.shape[0]`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\n\ndef merge_weight(W, A, B, alpha):\n    W, A, B = torch.tensor(W), torch.tensor(A), torch.tensor(B)\n    merged = W + (alpha / A.shape[0]) * B @ A\n    return [[round(v, 3) for v in row] for row in merged.tolist()]\n\nW = [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0]]\nA = [[1.0, 2.0]]\nB = [[1.0], [0.0]]\nprint(merge_weight(W, A, B, 1.0))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\n\ndef merge_weight(W, A, B, alpha):\n    W, A, B = torch.tensor(W), torch.tensor(A), torch.tensor(B)\n    merged = W + (alpha / A.shape[0]) * B @ A\n    return [[round(v, 3) for v in row] for row in merged.tolist()]\n\nW = [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0]]\nA = [[1.0, 2.0]]\nB = [[1.0], [0.0]]\nprint(merge_weight(W, A, B, 1.0))\n```"
